- [One of the Largest Banking Groups Worldwide in terms of tier 1 capital, Crédit Agricole CIB Selects Jobvite](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/one-of-the-largest-banking-groups-worldwide-credit-agricole-cib-selects-jobvite/) - March 27, 2019 Jobvite has announced Crédit Agricole Corporate and Investment Bank, headquartered in Singapore, has recently chosen to implement Jobvite Hire and Refer. They are the pioneer in the area of climate finance, and currently a market leader in this segment with a complete offer for all of its clients. Crédit Agricole CIB offers
