- [Recruiting Is Tougher in 2019](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/recruiting-is-tougher-in-2019/) - Today's jobs market is pushing talent acquisition professionals to rethink how they engage with and evaluate candidates. The latest Recruiter Nation Survey from Jobvite, a recruiting technology company, reveals the difficulties of attracting and hiring talent in a candidate-driven job market, as well as the creative methods recruiters are deploying to get job seekers' attention.
