- [Supporting 2014 Candidate Experience Awards as Platinum Sponsor](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/jobvite-supports-talent-boards-2014-candidate-experience-awards-platinum-sponsor/) - SAN FRANCISCO (July 8, 2014) –Talent Board, a non-profit organization focused on the elevation and promotion of a quality candidate experience, today announced that Jobvite, the complete recruiting solution serving the world’s fastest-growing companies — including Twitter, Starbucks and Zappos — will serve as a Platinum Sponsor of the 2014 Candidate Experience (CandE) Awards.
- [Quit Your Job! It Proves the Economy’s Getting Better](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/quit-job-proves-economys-getting-better/) - At this stage in the recovery —f ive years after the U.S. officially emerged from recession, labor economists would like to see the “quits rate” rise. It’s a measure of the percentage of people voluntarily leaving their employment — rather than being laid off or having a contract end. Workers might leave a job if they’ve been recruited for another one, or even to look for another job without having one already lined up. Or, they might quit to go back to school, or retire, or take a break from work altogether.
- [Inc. 5000](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/inc-5000-2/) - Jobvite ranked within the top 25 percent of all 5000 companies in the nation and is among the top five of all human resources companies from the state of California on this distinguished list.
- [Jobvite Delivers Most Comprehensive Mobile Experience Available to Customers](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/jobvite-delivers-comprehensive-mobile-experience-available-customers/) - San Mateo, Calif., June 24, 2014 — Jobvite, the complete recruiting solution serving the world’s fastest-growing companies, today announced the release of Jobvite’s mobile career website solution, the most comprehensive and seamless mobile recruiting solution of its kind on the market. With almost half of job seekers using mobile devices to engage in job-hunting activities, Jobvite customers will now have a competitive advantage with the ability to create complete, easy-to-use, and branded mobile career websites.
- [5 Secrets to Winning an Employee Referral and Getting Hired](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/5-secrets-winning-employee-referral-getting-hired/) - When it comes to landing a job fast, it’s all about the people you know — and the people who know you.
- [16 Things You’re Doing All Wrong on LinkedIn](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/16-things-youre-wrong-linkedin/) - It’s not enough to just sign up for LinkedIn, you also have to use it properly. And there’s the rub — click around the professional social network, and you’ll notice a spectrum of what users call proper that perhaps they shouldn’t.
- [Top of Your MBA Class—but Remedial in Social Media?](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/top-mba-class-remedial-social-media/) - Congratulations, Class of 2014! You navigated your way through accounting and calculus, macroeconomics, and marketing—but have you mastered the algorithm necessary to be a “social professional?”
- [Using Social Media for Job Search](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/using-social-media-job-search/) - Social media isn’t only about sharing family vacation photos and keeping in touch with old friends, it’s also an important tool in a job search. That is, if you use it right.
- [Optimize LinkedIn Like A Pro To Boost Your Personal Brand](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/optimize-linkedin-like-pro-boost-personal-brand/) - As a professional marketer, you have a story to tell about your background and experience, your skills and interests, and what you can add to the conversation in your area of expertise. Together, these pieces of the story paint a picture of your personal brand — a brand you create and grow over time as you move forward in your career whether you lead companies or join them.
- [Survey: More Employers Using Social Media As a Recruiting Tool](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/survey-employers-using-social-media-recruiting-tool/) - According to a survey by recruiting firm Jobvite, social media has quickly become a dominant force for companies to find and hire quality talent, allowing employers to tap extended networks for candidates that would not be found otherwise and offering tremendous value to companies of all sizes. It also has become an essential avenue for recruiters to successfully compete in the war for talent.
- [Jobvite and Ceridian Form Agreement To Provide Superior Talent Acquisition Solution](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/jobvite-ceridian-form-agreement-provide-superior-talent-acquisition-solution/) - San Francisco, Calif. — May 27, 2014 — Jobvite, the complete recruiting solution serving the world’s fastest-growing companies, today announced an agreement with Ceridian, a leader in human capital management. The agreement will offer Ceridian Dayforce Human Capital Management customers full access to Jobvite Refer and Jobvite Engage directly within the Dayforce Recruiting platform. This will open Jobvite to new markets and growth opportunities, while offering Ceridian’s more than 100,000 customers a best in class solution for discovering and hiring top talent.
- [What it takes to get a senior role in WPP](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/takes-get-senior-role-wpp/) - Jean-Michel Wu is the regional talent director for WPP Asia Pacific and has been with the company for more than a decade. He is responsible for executive recruiting and talent initiatives across WPP’s operating companies in Asia Pacific and also oversees the group’s fellowship programme in the region.
- [ZDNet Cloud TV: Impact of cloud on HR (full video)](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/news_item/zdnet-cloud-tv-impact-cloud-hr-full-video/) - GroupM's APAC head of talent acquisition Michael Wright explains how cloud has paved the way for big data to drive insights for human resources.
