## Events

- [Jobvite 2026 Winter Release Webinar](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/jobvite-2026-winter-release-webinar/) - What's New in Jobvite: Platform Upgrades, Forecasting, and Onboarding Improvements.
- [From Research to Results: Inside Recruiter Nation 2025](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/from-research-to-results-inside-recruiter-nation-2025/) - See what 1,200+ TA pros told us about today's recruiting realities, where they’re investing next, and how you can turn these insights into your 2026 strategy.
- [WEBINAR: Crafting a People-First Employee Journey: Balancing Technology and Empathy in Today’s Workforce](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/webinar-crafting-a-people-first-employee-journey-balancing-technology-and-empathy-in-todays-workforce/) - Don’t miss this opportunity to learn from industry experts and gain the tools to build a workplace where technology enhances—not replaces—the human connection.
- [Supercharge Your Hiring: Discover the Power of Pillar](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/supercharge-your-hiring-discover-the-power-of-pillar/) - See how Employ is rewriting the playbook for smarter, faster, and more responsible hiring.
- [The People-First, Intelligent Hiring Solution: Automate the Busy Work. Elevate the Human Touch (Jobvite Demo)](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/the-people-first-intelligent-hiring-solution-automate-the-busy-work-elevate-the-human-touch-jobvite-demo/) - Join us for a live 30-minute product demonstration where we'll show you how Jobvite's intelligent automation tools eliminate the busy work that eats up your recruiters' day. We'll show exactly how Jobvite frees your team to excel at what technology can't replicate: having the conversations that transform candidates into enthusiastic new hires.
- [HR Tech Webinar](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/hr-tech-webinar/) - Join Ben Eubanks of Lighthouse Research & Advisory, Stephanie Manzelli of Employ, and Ben Olsen from LinkedIn for a download on the five most game-changing trends shaking up talent acquisition. From AI-powered tools to automation that helps humans connect, this panel will discuss how to transform your hiring strategy in a people-first, tech-smart way.
- [SHRM Talent Conference & Expo](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/shrm-talent-conference-expo/) - Employ is proud to sponsor SHRM Talent. Position yourself and your organization for success as you keep up with the most recent emerging trends, identify game-changing developments, and proactively seek out innovative ideas to offer alternative benefits to foster a thriving company culture, maintain a competitive edge and achieve your financial goals.
- [WEBINAR: Making Talent Acquisition a Strategic Part of Workforce Planning and Growth](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/webinar-making-talent-acquisition-a-strategic-part-of-workforce-planning-and-growth/) - Watch Employ’s very own, Kim Stevens, Senior Talent Acquisition Manager, a powerhouse panel of industry experts share expert-backed strategies for attracting and recruiting the right talent in today’s labor market.
- [Hiring with Purpose: Balancing Speed, Quality, and Candidate Experience in 2025](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/hiring-with-purpose-balancing-speed-quality-and-candidate-experience-in-2025/) - Join us for a forward-thinking discussion on how to hire with purpose in 2025. Talent acquisition leaders will share strategies to balance speed, quality, and candidate experience in an increasingly competitive market. Learn how top companies are leveraging technology and data to streamline hiring without sacrificing engagement or standards.
- [HR Tech](https://3mw-dev-jobvite.pantheonsite.io/event/hr-tech/) - We are proud to be a diamond sponsor at the 2025 HR Technology Conference, the largest event dedicated to HR innovation. It brings together HR and IT leaders from around the globe to discover all the trends, tools, technology and insights to take HR strategies beyond best practice.

